10. Conclusion:

Skill Swap is a frontend web application that encourages collaborative learning through peer-to-peer skill exchange.
It enables users to showcase their expertise, discover learning opportunities, and simulate skill exchange requests in a responsive and user-friendly environment. 
The project demonstrates key frontend development concepts and provides a strong foundation for future full-stack enhancements.
